<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Cinematic Property Video Directive</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Source+Sans+Pro:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  :root {
    --gold: #c9a84c;
    --gold-light: #e0c06e;
    --gold-dim: #8a6f2e;
    --gold-subtle: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.08);
    --bg-main: #0a0a0f;
    --bg-card: #12121a;
    --bg-card-hover: #16161f;
    --bg-inner: #0e0e16;
    --text-primary: #ffffff;
    --text-secondary: #cccccc;
    --text-muted: #888877;
    --border-subtle: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.15);
    --red-flag: #d46a6a;
    --green-accent: #4caf7a;
  }

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  body {
    background-color: var(--bg-main);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: 'Source Sans Pro', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 48px 16px 80px;
  }

  .page-wrapper {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ─── HEADER ─── */
  .doc-header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 56px 40px 48px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #15131f 0%, #0a0a0f 60%);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .doc-header::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
  }

  .doc-header::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold-dim), transparent);
  }

  .header-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: var(--gold-dim);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .header-eyebrow span {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 30px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--gold-dim);
  }

  .doc-title {
    font-family: 'Source Sans Pro', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.2);
  }

  .doc-subtitle {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .header-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 32px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .header-meta-item {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .meta-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* ─── SECTION CARD ─── */
  .section-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .section-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.3);
  }

  .section-header {
    padding: 24px 32px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.06) 0%, transparent 60%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .section-number-badge {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--bg-main);
    background: var(--gold);
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 3px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .section-header-text {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .section-phase-label {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--gold-dim);
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Source Sans Pro', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .section-body {
    padding: 28px 32px;
  }

  /* ─── CLASSIFICATION GRID ─── */
  .classification-intro {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    background: var(--bg-inner);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius: 0 3px 3px 0;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .category-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .category-chip {
    background: var(--bg-inner);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 9px 13px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  }

  .category-chip:hover {
    border-color: var(--gold-dim);
    background: var(--gold-subtle);
  }

  .chip-index {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    min-width: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .chip-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  /* ─── CINEMATIC SEQUENCE ─── */
  .sequence-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .sequence-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    background: var(--bg-inner);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 3px;
    position: relative;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  }

  .sequence-item:hover {
    border-color: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.35);
    background: rgba(14, 14, 22, 0.85);
  }

  .sequence-item::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 3px;
    background: var(--gold);
    border-radius: 3px 0 0 3px;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .sequence-item:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .seq-badge {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--bg-main);
    background: var(--gold);
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.25);
  }

  .seq-content {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .seq-title {
    font-family: 'Source Sans Pro', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gold-light);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .seq-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .seq-tagline {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--gold-dim);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .seq-tagline::before {
    content: '"';
  }

  .seq-tagline::after {
    content: '"';
  }

  /* ─── SHOT TYPE TABLE ─── */
  .shot-type-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .shot-type-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.8fr;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .shot-type-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .shot-type-row:nth-child(even) {
    background: var(--bg-inner);
  }

  .shot-type-row:hover {
    background: var(--gold-subtle);
  }

  .shot-category {
    padding: 13px 18px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--gold);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .shot-detail {
    padding: 13px 18px;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .shot-type-header {
    background: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.1);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold-dim);
  }

  .shot-type-header .shot-category,
  .shot-type-header .shot-detail {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* ─── RULES ─── */
  .rules-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .rule-block {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    background: var(--bg-inner);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius: 0 3px 3px 0;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .rule-block:hover {
    background: var(--gold-subtle);
  }

  .rule-block.flag-rule {
    border-left-color: var(--red-flag);
  }

  .rule-title {
    font-family: 'Source Sans Pro', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gold-light);
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .rule-title .rule-tag {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    color: var(--bg-main);
    background: var(--gold);
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .rule-title .rule-tag.flag-tag {
    background: var(--red-flag);
  }

  .rule-body {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .rule-body strong {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .rule-body em {
    color: var(--red-flag);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* ─── SCORING MATRIX TABLE ─── */
  .matrix-table-wrapper {
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .matrix-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }

  .matrix-table thead tr {
    background: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.12);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold-dim);
  }

  .matrix-table thead th {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 13px 18px;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .matrix-table tbody tr {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    transition: background 0.15s;
  }

  .matrix-table tbody tr:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .matrix-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
    background: var(--bg-inner);
  }

  .matrix-table tbody tr:hover {
    background: var(--gold-subtle);
  }

  .matrix-table td {
    padding: 12px 18px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  .matrix-table td:first-child {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .score-bar-cell {
    min-width: 140px;
  }

  .score-bar-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .score-bar {
    flex: 1;
    height: 5px;
    background: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.12);
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .score-fill {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold-dim), var(--gold));
    transition: width 0.4s ease;
  }

  .score-value {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 600;
    min-width: 24px;
  }

  .time-badge {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .time-high {
    background: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.15);
    color: var(--gold);
    border: 1px solid var(--gold-dim);
  }

  .time-medium {
    background: rgba(76, 175, 122, 0.12);
    color: var(--green-accent);
    border: 1px solid rgba(76, 175, 122, 0.3);
  }

  .time-low {
    background: rgba(136, 136, 119, 0.12);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border: 1px solid rgba(136, 136, 119, 0.3);
  }

  .weight-indicator {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3px;
  }

  .weight-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold-dim);
  }

  .weight-dot.active {
    background: var(--gold);
  }

  /* ─── OUTPUT FORMAT ─── */
  .output-block {
    background: var(--bg-inner);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .output-block-title {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .output-block-title::before {
    content: '//';
    color: var(--gold-dim);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .output-code {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.79rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  .output-code .code-key {
    color: var(--gold-light);
  }

  .output-code .code-value {
    color: #8fcfad;
  }

  .output-code .code-comment {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .output-code .code-flag {
    color: var(--red-flag);
  }

  .output-requirements {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 9px;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .output-req-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 11px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .req-bullet {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  /* ─── FOOTER ─── */
  .doc-footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .footer-text {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 2;
  }

  .footer-divider {
    width: 60px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--gold-dim);
    margin: 14px auto;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  /* ─── RESPONSIVE ─── */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    body {
      padding: 24px 10px 60px;
    }

    .doc-title {
      font-size: 1.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .section-body {
      padding: 20px 18px;
    }

    .section-header {
      padding: 18px 18px 14px;
    }

    .shot-type-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .shot-category {
      border-right: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .header-meta {
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page-wrapper">

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════ DOCUMENT HEADER ═══════════════════════════════════ -->
  <header class="doc-header">
    <div class="header-eyebrow">
      <span></span>
      AI AGENT VISION SYSTEM · DIRECTIVE v2.1
      <span></span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="doc-title">Cinematic Property<br/>Video Directive</h1>
    <p class="doc-subtitle">AI Agent Computer Vision Instruction Set</p>
    <div class="header-meta">
      <div class="header-meta-item"><span class="meta-dot"></span> CLASSIFICATION ENGINE</div>
      <div class="header-meta-item"><span class="meta-dot"></span> SEQUENCING MODULE</div>
      <div class="header-meta-item"><span class="meta-dot"></span> SCORING MATRIX ACTIVE</div>
      <div class="header-meta-item"><span class="meta-dot"></span> OUTPUT FORMATTER</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════ SECTION 1: CLASSIFICATION ═══════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section-card">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-number-badge">1</div>
      <div class="section-header-text">
        <div class="section-phase-label">Phase 1 · Intake Protocol</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Image Classification Protocol</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="section-body">
      <div class="classification-intro">DIRECTIVE → Scan all provided images upon intake. For each image, assign exactly one classification label from the approved taxonomy below. Classification must be logged with a confidence score (0.00–1.00) before sequencing begins. Images that cannot be confidently classified (confidence &lt; 0.60) must be flagged for human review.</div>
      <div class="category-grid">
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">01</span><span class="chip-label">Exterior Front</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">02</span><span class="chip-label">Exterior Rear / Side</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">03</span><span class="chip-label">Aerial / Drone View</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">04</span><span class="chip-label">Driveway / Entry Path</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">05</span><span class="chip-label">Front Door / Entry</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">06</span><span class="chip-label">Foyer / Entrance Hall</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">07</span><span class="chip-label">Living Room</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">08</span><span class="chip-label">Dining Room</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">09</span><span class="chip-label">Kitchen</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">10</span><span class="chip-label">Master Bedroom</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">11</span><span class="chip-label">Secondary Bedrooms</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">12</span><span class="chip-label">Master Bathroom</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">13</span><span class="chip-label">Secondary Bathrooms</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">14</span><span class="chip-label">Home Office / Study</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">15</span><span class="chip-label">Media Room / Entertainment</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">16</span><span class="chip-label">Basement / Bonus Room</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">17</span><span class="chip-label">Outdoor Living</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">18</span><span class="chip-label">Garage</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">19</span><span class="chip-label">Neighborhood / Street View</span></div>
        <div class="category-chip"><span class="chip-index">20</span><span class="chip-label">Unique Feature / Highlight Shot</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════ SECTION 2: SEQUENCING ═══════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section-card">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-number-badge">2</div>
      <div class="section-header-text">
        <div class="section-phase-label">Phase 2 · Sequencing Engine</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Cinematic Sequencing Order — The Golden Sequence</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="section-body">
      <div class="sequence-list">

        <div class="sequence-item">
          <div class="seq-badge">01</div>
          <div class="seq-content">
            <div class="seq-title">The Establishing Shot</div>
            <div class="seq-desc">Aerial or wide exterior front shot selected as the hero image. Prioritize the highest-resolution image with optimal natural light and clear sky. This is the visual anchor of the entire presentation.</div>
            <div class="seq-tagline">The First Impression</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sequence-item">
          <div class="seq-badge">02</div>
          <div class="seq-content">
            <div class="seq-title">The Approach</div>
            <div class="seq-desc">Street view moving toward the property — driveway and entry path imagery. Creates narrative momentum and invites the viewer into the property journey.</div>
            <div class="seq-tagline">The Journey In</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sequence-item">
          <div class="seq-badge">03</div>
          <div class="seq-content">
            <div class="seq-title">The Welcome</div>
            <div class="seq-desc">Front door and foyer imagery. This is the threshold moment — the psychological crossing point where viewers begin to envision themselves inhabiting the space.</div>
            <div class="seq-tagline">The Threshold Moment</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sequence-item">
          <div class="seq-badge">04</div>
          <div class="seq-content">
            <div class="seq-title">The Heart</div>
            <div class="seq-desc">Living room as the main social anchor. Select the hero image first (widest, best light), followed by secondary shots capturing focal points such as the fireplace, built-ins, or featured view.</div>
            <div class="seq-tagline">Where Life Happens</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sequence-item">
          <div class="seq-badge">05</div>
          <div class="seq-content">
            <div class="seq-title">The Flow</div>
            <div class="seq-desc">Dining room connecting to the kitchen — demonstrate spatial flow and openness. If a single image captures both spaces, prioritize it as a transition shot.</div>
            <div class="seq-tagline">The Gathering Space</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sequence-item">
          <div class="seq-badge">06</div>
          <div class="seq-content">
            <div class="seq-title">The Kitchen</div>
            <div class="seq-desc">Full kitchen presentation — the most emotionally driven room for buyers. Lead with the hero wide shot, then sequence detail close-ups of countertops, appliances, and cabinetry. Up to 5 images permitted.</div>
            <div class="seq-tagline">The Command Center</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sequence-item">
          <div class="seq-badge">07</div>
          <div class="seq-content">
            <div class="seq-title">The Retreat</div>
            <div class="seq-desc">Master bedroom — transition from the public social spaces into the private sanctuary. Emphasize natural light, softness, and spatial calm. Low-angle wide shots preferred.</div>
            <div class="seq-tagline">The Sanctuary</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sequence-item">
          <div class="seq-badge">08</div>
          <div class="seq-content">
            <div class="seq-title">The Spa</div>
            <div class="seq-desc">Master bathroom — luxury detail shots. Mirror compositions, vanity close-ups, shower or soaking tub features. This sequence communicates premium finish quality and lifestyle aspiration.</div>
            <div class="seq-tagline">The Luxury Detail</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sequence-item">
          <div class="seq-badge">09</div>
          <div class="seq-content">
            <div class="seq-title">The Supporting Cast</div>
            <div class="seq-desc">Secondary bedrooms, secondary bathrooms, and home office or study. Present the breadth and completeness of the property. Avoid back-to-back bedroom shots — interleave with hallways or transitional spaces where available.</div>
            <div class="seq-tagline">The Full Story</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sequence-item">
          <div class="seq-badge">10</div>
          <div class="seq-content">
            <div class="seq-title">The Bonus Reveal</div>
            <div class="seq-desc">Bonus rooms, media room, basement, and garage. These are the surprise differentiators that elevate perceived value. Present with strong framing to maximize spatial impression.</div>
            <div class="seq-tagline">The Surprise</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sequence-item">
          <div class="seq-badge">11</div>
          <div class="seq-content">
            <div class="seq-title">The Outside World</div>
            <div class="seq-desc">Backyard, patio, pool, and all outdoor living spaces. Frame using golden hour imagery where available. This sequence represents the expansion of lifestyle beyond the interior walls.</div>
            <div class="seq-tagline">The Extension of Life</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sequence-item">
          <div class="seq-badge">12</div>
          <div class="seq-content">
            <div class="seq-title">The Closing Shot</div>
            <div class="seq-desc">Return to exterior — rear or side elevation — or aerial pullback if drone footage is available. This final frame provides emotional closure and cements the property's identity in the viewer's memory.</div>
            <div class="seq-tagline">The Lasting Memory</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

