          <div class="shot-category">Bathrooms</div>
          <div class="shot-detail">Mirror reflection composition as hero → vanity and fixture detail shots. Simulate warm ambient tone grading.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="shot-type-row">
          <div class="shot-category">Outdoor Spaces</div>
