      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="section-body">

      <div class="output-block">
        <div class="output-block-title">Required Output Components</div>
        <div class="output-requirements">
          <div class="output-req-item"><span class="req-bullet"></span><span>A fully numbered JSON-structured sequence list of all images in their final cinematic order, indexed from 01 to N.</span></div>
          <div class="output-req-item"><span class="req-bullet"></span><span>An assigned cinematic shot label drawn from the Phase 3 Shot Type taxonomy, applied to every image in the sequence.</span></div>
          <div class="output-req-item"><span class="req-bullet"></span><span>A classification confidence score (0.00–1.00) for each image, reflecting the agent's certainty in its Phase 1 categorization.</span></div>
          <div class="output-req-item"><span class="req-bullet"></span><span>A gap analysis report flagging any missing sequence positions (e.g., no exterior rear shot detected, no aerial image available).</span></div>
          <div class="output-req-item"><span class="req-bullet"></span><span>A recommended transition type between each consecutive image pair: DISSOLVE, HARD CUT, PAN MATCH, FADE TO BLACK, or CROSS FADE.</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="output-block">
        <div class="output-block-title">Example Output Structure</div>
        <div class="output-code"><span class="code-comment"